<p>A private transfer from Ibiza Airport (IBZ) to Mikasa Ibiza Boutique Hotel covers around 9 kilometres and takes about 20 minutes by car, running from the airport past Ibiza Town and out to Talamanca, a quiet bay just north of the harbour where the hotel sits close to the beach. Your driver waits at arrivals with a name board, tracks your flight in real time so pickup adjusts automatically if you land early or late, and takes you directly to the hotel's entrance rather than leaving you to find a taxi or work out a bus connection after a long flight.</p>
